[32m+[m[32m### 3. Support Content Creators[m[41m[m
README.md:168: trailing whitespace.
[32m+[m[32mWe deeply respect the hard work of artists, musicians, and content creators. **We strongly encourage all users to subscribe to [YouTube Premium](https://www.youtube.com/premium).** Purchasing a Premium subscription is the best way to financially support the creators you listen to and ensure the continued growth of the platform. SimpMusic is built as a proof-of-concept for developers and enthusiasts, not to harm creators' revenues.[m[41m[m
