[32m+[m[32m### 4. No Hosting of Copyrighted Material[m[41m[m
README.md:171: trailing whitespace.
[32m+[m[32mWe do not host, upload, distribute, or store any audio, video, or copyrighted media files on our own servers. All content accessed through this application is stored entirely on Google's/YouTube's servers and remains the property of their respective copyright owners. The app merely acts as a conduit to stream publicly accessible links.[m[41m[m
